---
// RelatedTool.astro - Chamada compacta para a ferramenta de Imagem para PDF
---

<section class="py-10 sm:py-12 bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft)] border-b border-[var(--color-hairline)]" aria-label="Ferramenta Relacionada">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas)] shadow-2xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-5">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-left">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-xs">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="9" y1="15" x2="15" y2="15"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] tracking-tight">
            Também precisa de PDF?
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Converta suas imagens em um único PDF.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="shrink-0 w-full sm:w-auto text-right">
        <a
          href="/imagem-para-pdf"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-[var(--color-on-primary)] text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-all shadow-xs active:scale-95 w-full sm:w-auto cursor-pointer"
        >
          <span>Converter para PDF &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
